The immediate project objective is to move repository-wide line coverage safely above
**80%** without manipulating coverage configuration or adding low-value execution-only
tests.

At the current denominator, reaching 80% repository-wide line coverage requires at
least **277 additional covered lines**. A safer buffer should be preferred so that
subsequent merges do not immediately drop the project below 80%.

## Motivation

